[36m(TaskRunner pid=2727803)[0m [response] We need to find the time Aya spends walking and in the coffee shop when she walks at a speed of \(s + \frac{1}{2}\) kilometers per hour.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2727803)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2727803)[0m 1. **Determine the time spent walking and in the coffee shop:**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2727803)[0m    - When Aya walks at \(s\) kilometers per hour, the time taken for the walk isincluding the coffee shop break is 4 hours. So, the time spent walking is \(4 - \frac{t}{60}\) hours.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2727803)[0m    - The distance covered in this time is \(s \times (4 - \frac{t}{60}) = 9\) kilometers.
