[36m(TaskRunner pid=2727803)[0m    - The distance covered in this time is \((s+2) \times (2.4 - \frac{t}{60}) = 9\) kilometers.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2727803)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2727803)[0m 2. **Set up the equations:**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2727803)[0m    - From the first scenario: \(s \times (4 - \frac{t}{60}) = 9\)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2727803)[0m    - From the second scenario: \((s+2) \times (2.4 - \frac{t}{60}) = 9\)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2727803)[0m 
