[36m(TaskRunner pid=2727803)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2727803)[0m [response] To find the area of triangle \(OAB\), we can use the formula for the area of a triangle given by two vectors. The area \(A\) of the triangle formed by vectors \(\overrightarrow{OA}\) and \(\overrightarrow{OB}\) is given by:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2727803)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2727803)[0m \[ A = \frac{1}{2} \| \overrightarrow{OA} \times \overrightarrow{OB} \| \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2727803)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2727803)[0m where \(\overrightarrow{OA} \times \overrightarrow{OB}\) is the cross product of the vectors \(\overrightarrow{OA}\) and \(\overrightarrow{OB}\), and \(\| \overrightarrow{OA} \times \overrightarrow{OB} \|\) is the magnitude of the cross product.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2727803)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2727803)[0m First, let's compute the cross product \(\overrightarrow{OA} \times \overrightarrow{OB}\):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2727803)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2727803)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2727803)[0m \overrightarrow{OA} = \begin{pmatrix} 1 \\ 2 \\ 3 \end{pmatrix}, \quad \overrightarrow{OB} = \begin{pmatrix} -3 \\ -2 \\ 1 \end{pmatrix}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2727803)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2727803)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2727803)[0m The cross product \(\overrightarrow{OA} \times \overrightarrow{OB}\) is given by:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2727803)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2727803)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2727803)[0m \overrightarrow{OA} \times \overrightarrow{OB} = \begin{vmatrix} \mathbf{i} & \mathbf{j} & \mathbf{k} \\ 1 & 2 & 3 \\ -3 & -2 & 1 \end{vmatrix}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2727803)[0m = \mathbf{i}(2 \cdot 1 - 3 \cdot (-2)) - \mathbf{j}(1 \cdot 1 - 3 \cdot (-3)) + \mathbf{k}(1 \cdot (-2) - 2 \cdot (-3))
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2727803)[0m = \mathbf{i}(2 + 6) - \mathbf{j}(1 + 9) + \mathbf{k}(-2 + 6)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2727803)[0m = 8\mathbf{i} - 10\mathbf{j} + 4\mathbf{k}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2727803)[0m = \begin{pmatrix} 8 \\ -10 \\ 4 \end{pmatrix}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2727803)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2727803)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2727803)[0m Next, we need to find the magnitude of the cross product vector:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2727803)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2727803)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2727803)[0m \| \overrightarrow{OA} \times \overrightarrow{OB} \| = \sqrt{8^2 + (-10)^2 + 4^2} = \sqrt{64 + 100 + 16} = \sqrt{180} = 6\sqrt{5}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2727803)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2727803)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2727803)[0m Finally, the area of the triangle \(OAB\) is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2727803)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2727803)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2727803)[0m A = \frac{1}{2} \| \overrightarrow{OA} \times \overrightarrow{OB} \| = \frac{1}{2} \cdot 6\sqrt{5} = 3\sqrt{5}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2727803)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2727803)[0m 
