[36m(TaskRunner pid=2727803)[0m 3. Take the reciprocal of this result and add it to 3:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2727803)[0m \[ 3 + \frac{3}{10} = \frac{30}{10} + \frac{3}{10} = \frac{33}{10} \]
